[[127,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>- Place the seat in the rear end of travel position.</p><p>1. Undo the lever retaining bolts.</p><p>2. Remove the lever.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"media/939004153.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[127,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>- Check that the lever is not damaged.</p><p>- Fit the lever.</p><p>- Tighten the bolts.</p><p>- Place the seat in a middle position.</p>"]]